    "enUS": {
      "description": "The flying creatures of the Summit still draw breath from the highest currents, where the corruption has not yet fully taken hold. Hippogryph feathers and chimaera hair drift through these winds, absorbing what the air remembers of an unspoiled land. I need these remnants to anchor and strengthen my purifying incense.\r\n\r\nGather them for me, so I may concentrate the wind's knowledge into cleansing smoke before we begin the ritual.",
